an document, not standalone issues):\n60\t\n61\t| ID | Title | Type | Team | Priority |\n62\t|---|---|---|---|---|\n63\t| RHAISTRAT-9005-BRANCH-A-E008 | Kueue-native gang admission configuration for multi-node training jobs | Implementation | Distributed Workloads | P0 |\n64\t| RHAISTRAT-9005-BRANCH-B-E008 | Provision coscheduling scheduler-plugin for gang scheduling | Implementation | Distributed Workloads | P0 |\n65\t| RHAISTRAT-9005-BRANCH-B-E009 | Gang admission integration for training jobs via scheduler plugin | Implementation | Distributed Workloads | P0 |\n66\t\n67\t## Dependency DAG (main plan)\n68\t\n69\t```mermaid\n70\tgraph TD\n71\t    E001[\"E001 Validate gang admission semantics (Investigation)\"]\n72\t    E002[\"E002 Preemption semantics investigation\"]\n73\t    E003[\"E003 Topology TP maturity investigation\"]\n74\t    E004[\"E004 Per-project GPU quota enforcement\"]\n75\t    E005[\"E005 Preemption policy implementation\"]\n76\t    E006[\"E006 Topology-aware placement\"]\n77\t    E007[\"E007 Dashboard queue/quota/admission visibility\"]\n78\t    E002 --> E005\n79\t    E003 --> E006\n80\t    E004 --> E007\n81\t```\n82\t\n83\tBranch DAG (conditional, gated by E001; excluded from the main-plan critical path):\n84\t\n85\t```mermaid\n86\tgraph TD\n87\t    E001[\"E001 Validate gang admission semantics\"]\n88\t    BA[\"BRANCH-A-E008 Kueue-native gang admission (outcome A)\"]\n89\t    BB1[\"BRANCH-B-E008 Provision coscheduling plugin (outcome B)\"]\n90\t    BB2[\"BRANCH-B-E009 Job integration via plugin (outcome B)\"]\n91\t    E001 --> BA\n92\t    E001 --> BB1\n93\t    E001 --> BB2\n94\t    BB1 --> BB2\n95\t```\n96\t\n97\t## DAG Justification\n98\t\n99\t| Edge | Rule | Rationale |\n100\t|---|---|---|\n101\t| E001 → BRANCH-A-E008 | Rule 3 | Gang-admission validation selects the implementation approach; true gate (`rewrite`). Bounded outcomes (Kueue-native sufficient vs scheduler-plugin needed) → conditional branches. |\n102\t| E001 → BRANCH-B-E008 | Rules 3,